+     * On a stream the server opens, each side sent up to the other window
+     * and the receiver closed the connection with FLOW_CONTROL_ERROR.  The
+     * draft litespeedtech/lsquic#629 has the same two limits under the same
+     * names, and the same limit for a unidirectional stream after 0-RTT.
